OL,3,AFamily pays tribute to 'warm and
OL,4,Aengaging' man killed in tiger attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who was killed by a
OL,7,Ftiger after he entered its enclosure at
OL,8,Fa wildlife park has paid tribute,
OL,9,Fdescribing him as "bright, warm and
OL,10,Fengaging".
OL,12,FWilliam Chapman, 23, visited Yorkshire
OL,13,FWildlife Park near Doncaster on
OL,14,FSaturday and was attacked after going
OL,15,Finto the animal's pen. He was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FIn a statement, his family said that he
OL,19,Fhad suffered from "significant mental
OL,20,Fillness" over a number of years and had
OL,21,Fbeen prescribed "strong medication".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
