OL,3,AZelensky and Burnham to meet in Downing
OL,4,AStreet
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham will host
OL,7,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fat Downing Street on Wednesday, as the
OL,9,FUK announces it will accelerate its
OL,10,Fdelivery of air defence missiles to
OL,11,FKyiv.
OL,13,FBurnham is also expected to set out how
OL,14,Fhis government will draw up further
OL,15,Fsanctions against Russia.
OL,17,FSpeaking ahead of the meeting, Burnham
OL,18,Fsaid the UK was with Ukraine "for as
OL,19,Flong as it takes", adding: "Russian
OL,20,Faggression cannot be allowed to succeed
OL,21,Fon our continent."
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
