OL,3,ASaudi man charged with planting
OL,4,A'sophisticated' recording device in
OL,5,AOpenAI office
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Saudi national has been charged with
OL,8,Fsecretly planting a recording device in
OL,9,Fone of OpenAI's offices in California,
OL,10,Ffederal prosecutors announced.
OL,12,FAbdulrahman Alfozan, who worked at the
OL,13,FAI firm as an engineer, was charged
OL,14,Ffederally with using or endeavoring to
OL,15,Fuse an electronic, mechanical, or other
OL,16,Fdevice to intercept oral
OL,17,Fcommunications.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
