OL,3,AMissiles intercepted near Riyadh after
OL,4,ASaudi coalition hits Yemen fuel depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FMissiles and drones have been
OL,7,Fintercepted over Riyadh after the
OL,8,FSaudi-led coalition fighting in Yemen
OL,9,Fstruck a fuel depot near the
OL,10,FHouthi-controlled capital, Sanaa, its
OL,11,Fspokesperson says.
OL,13,FMaj Gen Turki al-Maliki said several
OL,14,Fprojectiles targeting the Saudi capital
OL,15,Fand other cities were intercepted after
OL,16,Fthe coalition carried out a strike on
OL,17,Fthe Yemen Petroleum Company's al-Sabaha
OL,18,Ffacility on Tuesday night.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
